				}
			]
		],
		"1067316": [
			"**Steps:**\n\n- First, dig up the [Dig Spots](https://mapgenie.io/call-of-duty-vanguard/maps/zombies-terra-maledicta?search=dig_spot%20%26%26%20category%3A28626) around the map until Lost Tome Pages drop.\n- Continue digging until four lost tome pages have been acquired.\n- While digging, you'll also come across a Ray Gun that comes out of the ground with zombies spawning nearby. \n  - The Ray Gun will move to a [Sealed Room](#loc=1067352), which will be opened at the end of the Easter Egg.\n- Once all four are acquired and the Ray Gun has been moved from the dig spot, head to the Sealed Room.\n- Interact with the door four times to place the pages onto the door.\n  - Each page needs to be placed in a specific order. The order is random for each game, so the solution requires trial and error.\n- Once all four are placed, the room will open, revealing the Ray Gun and a Death Machine.",
			[]
		],
		"1067324": [
			"**Steps:**\n\n- First, dig up the [Dig Spots](https://mapgenie.io/call-of-duty-vanguard/maps/zombies-terra-maledicta?search=dig_spot%20%26%26%20category%3A28626) around the map until a red orb spawns.\n- Chase and shoot the red orb in the sky until it drops to the ground.\n- Interact with the red orb to spawn ten Bonus Points power-ups.\n  - This can be done multiple times in one game.",
			[]
		],
		"1067326": [
			"",
			[
				{
					"id": 160776,
					"title": "20261111000016_1",
					"file_name": "5067b555-5178-40a8-bd7a-806d62f430a6.jpg",
					"attribution": "",
					"url": "https://media.mapgenie.io/storage/media/5067b555-5178-40a8-bd7a-806d62f430a6.jpg",
					"type": "image",
					"mime_type": "image/jpeg",
					"meta": null,
					"order": 10,
					"spoiler": false
				}
			]
		],
		"1067340": [
			"**Steps:**\n\n- First, dig up the [Dig Spots](https://mapgenie.io/call-of-duty-vanguard/maps/zombies-terra-maledicta?search=dig_spot%20%26%26%20category%3A28626) around the map until a blue orb spawns and corrupts you.\n  - While corrupted, your health will be cut in half.\n- Find a red rune scattered around the map and bury the heart inside it.\n- Once buried, you will receive a free sacrificial heart.",
			[]
		],
		"1067352": [
			"**Related Easter Egg:** [Free Ray Gun and Death Machine Easter Egg](#loc=1067316)",
			[
				{
					"id": 160782,
					"title": "20261111001554_1",
					"file_name": "865ebfd5-4643-4786-a8cf-b9c2c11efa50.jpg",
					"attribution": "",
					"url": "https://media.mapgenie.io/storage/media/865ebfd5-4643-4786-a8cf-b9c2c11efa50.jpg",
					"type": "image",
					"mime_type": "image/jpeg",
					"meta": null,
					"order": 10,
					"spoiler": false
				}
			]
		],
		"1067362": [
			"**Steps:**\n\n- First, dig up the [Dig Spots](https://mapgenie.io/call-of-duty-vanguard/maps/zombies-terra-maledicta?search=dig_spot%20%26%26%20category%3A28626) around the map until an antenna drops.\n- Place the antenna on the [Antenna Radio](#loc=1067363) against the wall on Merchant Road.\n- Around the map, three other antennas will now need to be rotated by interacting with the radio:\n  - [Antenna Radio](#loc=1067369)\n  - [Antenna Radio](#loc=1067368)\n  - [Antenna Radio](#loc=1067366)\n- After rotating the last antenna, a large amount of Sturmkriegers will spawn.\n- Once defeating the last one, it will drop a chest with a variety of loot.",
			[]
		],
		"1067363": [
			"**Related Easter Egg:** [Random Loot Easter Egg](#loc=1067362)",
			[
				{
