		"1067380": [
			"**Steps:**\n\n- First, complete a portal objective at one of the [Challenge Portals,](https://mapgenie.io/call-of-duty-vanguard/maps/zombies-terra-maledicta?search=challenge_portal%20%26%26%20category%3A28646)\n- Once you've unlocked the Merchant Road area to the east of the Temple, head close to the [Decimator Shield](#loc=1067377) trapped on a crystal to get a dialog sequence.\n- Next, complete another portal objective.\n- Then, head to the Tents area and interact with the [Ancient Corrupt Rune](#loc=1067238) to spawn a challenge portal.\n- Once completed, head back to the Decimator Shield to get another dialog sequence.\n- Next, head around the map and destroy four yellow crystals:\n  - [Yellow Crystal](#loc=1067399)\n  - [Yellow Crystal](#loc=1067397)\n  - [Yellow Crystal](#loc=1067395)\n  - [Yellow Crystal](#loc=1067392)\n- Once all four are destroyed, head to the second [Ancient Corrupt Rune](#loc=1067403) inside the Bazaar and interact with it.\n- Head through the new portal that spawns to fight a boss.\n- Once defeated, the Decimator Shield will break free and will be useable.\n  - The Decimator Shield acts as a weapon, taking up a weapon slot.",
			[]
		],
