		"1067415": [
			"**Steps:**\n\n- First, acquire the Decimator Shield by completing the [Decimator Shield Easter Egg](#loc=1067380).\n- Once acquired, head to the final [Ancient Corrupt Rune](#loc=1067417) and interact with it to spawn the final portal.\n- Head inside and use the alternative fire on the Decimator Shield to break the connections holding the Tome Page.\n- Once done, the red orb will fall. Interact with it to receive the Tome Page and a variety of loot once back in the desert.",
			[]
		],
